  cutsceneName: Level 1 - Strange Robot Gathering
  lines:
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b06bacec7d0355448a4bb23bac5f4496, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: Well this is something
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3e44d288864a64349b6d1bdcc7bc827b, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: I get the getter team and you showing up together, but not every day you see the White Meteor with us
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c7a96261f43436c4abb7b9c0ce8c4086, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: "please don\u2019t call me that, im nobody special"
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b06bacec7d0355448a4bb23bac5f4496, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: "Nobody special?! You\u2019re THE gundam pilot"
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c5c9a7f2695ae34ba63db5ad62a57dc, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: Yeah, when you think about it, all of us here are special
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae3af38c8b715514e99a2923e7974548, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: Even me, right guys?
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b06bacec7d0355448a4bb23bac5f4496, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: ...
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c7a96261f43436c4abb7b9c0ce8c4086, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: ...
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3e44d288864a64349b6d1bdcc7bc827b, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: ...
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae3af38c8b715514e99a2923e7974548, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: awe come on guys, I can carry myself, I promise. I have the GUTS for it
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b06bacec7d0355448a4bb23bac5f4496, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: your not Noriko
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3e44d288864a64349b6d1bdcc7bc827b, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: is Noriko even in this demo?
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b06bacec7d0355448a4bb23bac5f4496, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: heck if I know
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c7a96261f43436c4abb7b9c0ce8c4086, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: "looks like we don\u2019t have time to think about that, look!"
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c5c9a7f2695ae34ba63db5ad62a57dc, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: Zakus?! Is Zeon after us?
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b06bacec7d0355448a4bb23bac5f4496, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: and Mechanical Beasts! Zeon must be working with Dr. Hell
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c7a96261f43436c4abb7b9c0ce8c4086, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: "no, I don\u2019t think so. Besides, that\u2019s too big for a demo"
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae3af38c8b715514e99a2923e7974548, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: what could it be then?
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c7a96261f43436c4abb7b9c0ce8c4086, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: Char.
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c7a96261f43436c4abb7b9c0ce8c4086, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: He must be testing us to see if we can make it to him in this "demo war"
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b06bacec7d0355448a4bb23bac5f4496, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: in that case all we have to do is smash them all!!!
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b06bacec7d0355448a4bb23bac5f4496, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: lets go everyone! We are the dream team after all!
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c7a96261f43436c4abb7b9c0ce8c4086, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: Lauching the Gundam!!
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3e44d288864a64349b6d1bdcc7bc827b, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: Change Getter 1, Switch on!
    showPortrait: 1
  - pilot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b06bacec7d0355448a4bb23bac5f4496, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    dialogue: Mazing-GO!
    showPortrait: 1
